Honor the selected installation prefix for the session D-Bus service.
Do not install a private EFL build into the system dbus package's prefix.
Local EmberBSD change; AI-assisted, not submitted upstream.

--- dbus-services/meson.build.orig
+++ dbus-services/meson.build
@@ -15,4 +15,4 @@
   input: 'org.enlightenment.Ethumb.service.in',
   output: 'org.enlightenment.Ethumb.service',
   configuration: org_enlightenment_ethumb_service_config,
-  install_dir: dep.get_pkgconfig_variable('session_bus_services_dir'))
+  install_dir: join_paths(dir_data, 'dbus-1', 'services'))
